<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 md:py-20">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
    <div class="flex flex-col space-y-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
        <span class="w-fit bg-blue-200 px-2 font-semibold text-gray-800">Our Story</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800">How Algobyte Came to Be</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        PT. Algobyte Teknologi Nusantara was established as a technology company focused on developing modern, secure, and sustainable digital solutions. Founded in 2025, we began our journey as a growing team passionate about building high-quality products with the best development standards.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        For us, technology is not just about getting the job done — it's about creating solutions that are stable, secure, and deliver real value to clients. We believe every project is a form of trust. That's why every system we build is designed with security, performance, scalability, and professional reliability at its core.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <%= lucide_icon("map-pin", class: "size-4 text-orange-600") %>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium">Bandung, Indonesia</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <%= lucide_icon("calendar", class: "size-4 text-orange-600") %>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium">Founded in 2025</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-700">
          <%= lucide_icon("users", class: "size-4 text-orange-600") %>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium">9+ clients served</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-center">
      <canvas
        data-controller="lottie"
        data-lottie-src-value="<%= asset_path('animation-1.lottie') %>"
        class="w-full h-80">
      </canvas>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
